<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson says wins BT contract.</title>
<headline>Ericsson says wins BT contract.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's LM Ericsson AB said it won a contract with BT Mobile to upgrade BT's wide area paging network.</p>
<p>The contract will be completed in 1997 and will provide further network capacity to meet growing need from BT, Ericsson said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
